    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to our facility! Here, you\u2019ll experience the thrill of strategic duels \u2013 block attacks, acquire ammo, and shoot your opponent. We hope you enjoy your stay with us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are similar to rock, paper, scissors: Both players make decisions at the same time. They have three options: block, get ammo, and shoot. In order to shoot, the player needs to get ammo first, but if the opponent shoots when the player gets ammo, they get shot. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with Friends or Strangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.poster.avif?t=1754876234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.webm?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.mp4?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends or use  matchmaking to connect with other  <span class=\"bb_strike\">nasty</span> friendly guests!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ability Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.poster.avif?t=1754876234\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.webm?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.mp4?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the upper hand with powerful ability cards that can turn the tide of any duel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Edit Your Face</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.poster.avif?t=1754876234\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.webm?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We understand the importance of self-expression. Customize your helmet and show the world your true face \u2013 or at least, the one you want to show.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to our facility! Here, you\u2019ll experience the thrill of strategic duels \u2013 block attacks, acquire ammo, and shoot your opponent. We hope you enjoy your stay with us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are similar to rock, paper, scissors: Both players make decisions at the same time. They have three options: block, get ammo, and shoot. In order to shoot, the player needs to get ammo first, but if the opponent shoots when the player gets ammo, they get shot. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with Friends or Strangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.poster.avif?t=1754876234\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.webm?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.mp4?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends or use  matchmaking to connect with other  <span class=\"bb_strike\">nasty</span> friendly guests!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ability Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.poster.avif?t=1754876234\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.webm?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.mp4?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the upper hand with powerful ability cards that can turn the tide of any duel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Edit Your Face</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.poster.avif?t=1754876234\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301930/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.webm?t=1754876234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We understand the importance of self-expression. Customize your helmet and show the world your true face \u2013 or at least, the one you want to show.</p>",
